          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Discover, design, and debate"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.125,
            0.743,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": "Design and create comic strips from real-life examples to differentiate between elements, compounds, and mixtures with diagrams and illustrate their properties and uses."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.187,
            0.743,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": "z Search for discoveries of some elements (such as phosphorus, sodium), compounds (such as penicillin) and mixtures (such as brass, bronze, stainless steel). Present your findings in the class."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.752,
            0.131,
            0.97,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
