        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.266,
            0.743,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": "z Let us search: Read labels on items like detergents or snacks, and try to list the mixtures and compounds they contain."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.829,
            0.241,
            0.931,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": "**Interdisciplinary Projects**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.308,
            0.744,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": "z Work in groups: Each group will pretend to be in the role of either an element, a compound, or a mixture. Debate which category among them is the most important."
